c_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9drHO63dGaQpVY5VWnynkPCln6m86G3X5xNmV1j6CLCw&oe=6A3D3F8B"}, "display_name": "POLYBLOCS", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Research-Creation Project: The Polyblocs construction game, integrated into a virtual environment, enables the rapid creation of prototypes, offering a playful and participatory way to shape architectural concepts. The Polyblocs tool provides practitioners with a space for freedom and agency often lacking in conventional architectural design solutions, fostering spontaneous expression in the previsualization process.\n\n", "short_description": "The Polyblocs construction game, integrated into a virtual environment, enables rapid prototyping, offering a playful, participatory approach to architectural design while fostering freedom and spontaneity in previsualization.\n\n\n"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "cov1.png", "id": "2351174138582301", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974759_2351174141915634_2969451169120856586_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hjtILPHfkjUQ7kNvwGDhiBB&_nc_oc=Adpx9_mVecBrDAOJysqhrNleJ3UOcbfJa8JFZkLRs-bzYuenF8paGp9EWbFhYVTRNNw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_U5P8aifjepiSwqFHQVah72eoOcyseRS64w3IiUDoF2Q&oe=6A3D3309"}, {"file_name": "cov4.png", "id": "1531289950891358", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75485579_1531289954224691_4417623240716955788_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=p020b0TxoIQQ7kNvwERkKSH&_nc_oc=AdpB82kZNdfZ6bqOYI_N6K1snUM0rCOkhm3WY31FeyFeAe5t_-Y6v7-80LKw7c-h1hk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9kZR-GwJU2I5pIGVIijQYPYRmMuHjAN95qQ4xzQ146KA&oe=6A3D313D"}, {"file_name": "banner pb 1440 1440 v2.png", "id": "1498865307473211", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.577